  C01 comparison error                     3.690e-04    measured two-sided bound
  C22a P_local quantisation                6.464e-08    8.08e-15 x (n+1), n = 8000000
  C22b P_global' at N == 1                 0.000e+00    conservative at every N
  C22c ZALPHA vs the literal 2.576         2.160e-03    measured at n = 8000000 (ceiling falls with n)

