  FLOOR, F07 reading            0.90386361725744824   (h' - 0.000369065)
    F07 is this audit's own disposition: the tool uses the exact 0.995 quantile and the
    standard's text prints its rounding, so C22c is a literal-text parity term, not a defect.

  EXCLUDED, not subtracted:
    C07, C03  closed by code on master at d226f18 and later. For a figure from tag
